---
export function getStaticPaths() {
    return [
        // {params: {path: 'rules'}}
    ]
}

const { path } = Astro.params;

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'

---
<Layout title="Rules">
    <section class="item">
        <h2><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>
        <p><strong>Winning</strong>: The last player alive wins the game. Try to vanquish your opponent! OR First to land on their opponents starting tiles wins the game. </p>
        <ul>
            <li>You have two actions per turn (Explore tiles or move to gain an advantage)
                <ul>
                    <li>Players can take damage from unlucky exploration or being attacked.</li>
                    <li>Each player has two lives</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="item">
        <h2><strong>Movement</strong></h2>
        <p>Players can only move to directly adjacent tiles. </p>
        <ul>
            <li>You <strong>cannot</strong> move diagonally between tiles.</li>
            <li>You <strong>cannot</strong> move to a tile that another player is on</li>
            <li>You cannot move out of bounds.</li>
        </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
        <h2><strong>Actions</strong></h2>
        <p>Each player gets <strong>2 actions per turn</strong> on the side of the river you start on, and <strong>3 actions</strong> on the opposite side. </p>
        <ul>
            <li>An action can be used to   <ul>
            <li><strong>Move (1x)</strong>  </li>
            <li><strong>...g>Arrows (2x): 1 Gold</strong>  </li>
            <li><strong>Raft (1x): 2 Gold</strong></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="item">
        <h2><strong>Combat</strong></h2>
        <p>You can attack your opponent. Attacking costs an action. </p>
        <p>You can use an action regenerate health (<strong>Max health is 5)</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>-2 food for +1 health</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Lvl. 1 sword:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>-1 health to the opponent</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Lvl. 2 sword:</strong><br>Roll a die to determine damage</p>
        <ul>
            <li>1/2/3: -1 health to the opponent  </li>
            <li>4/5/6: -2 health to the opponent</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Lvl. 3 sword:</strong><br>Roll a die to determine damage</p>
        <ul>
            <li>1/2/3: -2 health to the opponent  </li>
            <li>4/5/6: -3 health to the opponent</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Bow:</strong><br>-1 arrow every time you attack</p>
        <ul>
            <li>-1 health to the opponent</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="item">
        <h2><strong>Robber</strong></h2>
        <p>The robber will take 1 gold from you (-1 gold)</p>
        <p>If you do not have gold, the robber will take 1 food (-1 food)</p>
    </section>
</Layout>